      "content": "5.1 Forest Cover"
    },
    {
      "id": "edy6gsj",
      "type": "image",
      "imageId": "js5237o",
      "src": "/books/Guide/Odisha CONSTABLE/images/image_js5237o.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "According to the India State of Forest Report 2021, Odisha has a forest cover of approximately 52,156 sq. km, constituting about 33.50% of its geographical area, which is above the national average. Odisha is one of India's leading states in forest biodiversity.",
      "id": "h5ohy7f"
    },
